  lines:
  - speaker: Old Man
    text: Ah! There you are. Finally!
    textID: 
  - speaker: Old Man
    text: You must be Everette, right? From New Hamp-
    textID: 
  - speaker: Eve
    text: Um... Just Eve.. please
    textID: 
  - speaker: Eve
    text: (God, this place actually looks pretty nice. At least from the outside.)
    textID: 
  - speaker: Eve
    text: "And... you\u2019re Mr. Finch?"
    textID: 
  - speaker: Mr Finch
    text: Correct, Mr Finch works just fine
    textID: 
  - speaker: Mr Finch
    text: "It\u2019s nice to finally meet you, Eve. Long trip? Willowmere can be
      a little tricky to get around if you\u2019re not from here."
    textID: 
  - speaker: Eve
    text: "You could say that. Your job listing said the caf\xE9 was easy to find."
    textID: 
  - speaker: Mr Finch
    text: Did it?
    textID: 
  - speaker: Mr Finch
    text: "Well... I suppose I might\u2019ve been a little optimistic."
    textID: 
  - speaker: Eve
    text: Right
    textID: 
